


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_f7c641c2:


    "现在屋里只有伦和圣夜子两个人。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_87fcf5cc:


    "本来文是和圣夜子一起回来的，但当知道阳菜去了屋顶后便马上跑了出去。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_d25f23df:



    voice "2RI_1281"
    rin "「圣夜夜，你和浅生说了什么吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_d46f7889:


    "伦已经换上睡衣坐在床上了。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_8f6ab8ac:



    voice "2MI_1016"
    miyako "「嗯，稍微聊了聊，你怎么知道的？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_2cdf501c:



    voice "2RI_1282"
    rin "「浅生看上去没那么忧郁了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_5d2e7d28:


    "圣夜子脱下围巾时笑了笑。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_caaab709:



    voice "2RI_1283"
    rin "「谢啦」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_f7bb48ee:



    voice "2MI_1017"
    miyako "「嗯？为什么伦要和我道谢？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_02eb151d:



    voice "2RI_1284"
    rin "「我是靠她们俩支撑自己活着的，所以要是她们俩没什么活力可不行。最坏情况下会死的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_0eaa3bd1:



    voice "2MI_1018"
    miyako "「这、这么严重？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_cf6f73a8:



    voice "2RI_1285"
    rin "「死可能有点夸张了，但真的非常困扰」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_4f4f5ee4:



    voice "2MI_1019"
    miyako "「确实之前也听你说过，她们俩是我的希望什么的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_3c4641cd:



    voice "2RI_1286"
    rin "「嗯，在和她们俩一起生活前，我还挺叛逆的……可以说我当时是个很招人厌的家伙」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_f84e5434:



    voice "2MI_1020"
    miyako "「记得是“我不喜欢集体生活……”来着？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_9d74a7d8:



    voice "2RI_1287"
    rin "「……圣夜夜」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_6ad23a32:


    "虽然这句黑历史经常被提到，还是会在伦身上打出伤害。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_401d367d:



    voice "2RI_1288"
    rin "「但是啊，就是因为有她们我才开始喜欢和人接触了。变得坦率了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_276b50cd:



    voice "2MI_1021"
    miyako "「变得坦率了？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_26a82d78:



    voice "2RI_1289"
    rin "「……为了变得坦率而努力」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_3bad1d69:



    voice "2MI_1022"
    miyako "「啊哈哈，在努力在努力」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_11a1fa78:



    voice "2RI_1290"
    rin "「总之呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_79802d99:


    "圣夜子点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_1cda35ad:


    rin_miyako "「希望她们幸福的在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_55dba1e4:


    "——屋顶。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_3d9aeb2c:



    voice "2HI_1245"
    hina "「……小文？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_773944b0:



    voice "2FU_0992"
    fumi "「听说你在这里」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_53e72a9e:


    "两人沉默着并排靠在围栏上。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_4529f127:


    "但两人之间的气氛稍微柔和了些，而她们自己也感觉到了这种变化。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_b6d9d5f7:



    voice "2HI_1246"
    hina "「小文」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_a19aeaba:



    voice "2FU_0993"
    fumi "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_b5c38501:


    "先开口的是阳菜。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_89e53c79:



    voice "2HI_1247"
    hina "「刚才因为我们俩的事被伦凶了一顿」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_5415d3ad:



    voice "2FU_0994"
    fumi "「咦？我们俩搞砸了什么吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_13259be0:



    voice "2HI_1248"
    hina "「啊哈，被凶了顿……不过也可以算是被鼓励一番吧」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_3e2e8f8f:


    "阳菜把伦说给她的话告诉了文。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_187bebdb:


    "喜欢上一个人是很自然的事情，任何人都没有权利决定它是不自然的，然后还有各种各样的……"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_ac0392bd:



    voice "2HI_1249"
    hina "「从平时的伦完全想象不出她当时激动的样子，她告诉了我许多允许女孩子和女孩子结婚的国家。说得像绕口令一样，特别厉害」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_a94c23ef:



    voice "2FU_0995"
    fumi "「连这个都帮我们调查了，好开心」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_2e51ab55:



    voice "2HI_1250"
    hina "「还有啊，伦说她的舌头是剑。会干掉否定我们俩的人」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_279ea2ca:



    voice "2FU_0996"
    fumi "「这样啊……绪方同学是剑啊」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_6e6e5a17:



    voice "2HI_1251"
    hina "「嗯？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_20d83bab:



    voice "2FU_0997"
    fumi "「那个，我也被圣夜子鼓励了呢」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_889762f7:



    voice "2HI_1252"
    hina "「哎？是吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_8ff29193:



    voice "2FU_0998"
    fumi "「圣夜子说会成为我们的盾」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_9cf03486:



    voice "2HI_1253"
    hina "「伦是剑，圣夜子是盾！无敌了！」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_32f930d8:



    voice "2FU_0999"
    fumi "「是呀。我和她说自己有罪恶感，然后她反问我觉得自己有什么罪孽，一下子答不出来」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_9b38edd6:



    voice "2HI_1254"
    hina "「嗯……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_81453396:



    voice "2FU_1000"
    fumi "「然后她就说没有什么罪名可以惩罚相爱着的两人的幸福，除了我们俩自己的想法以外没有什么可以分开我们」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_0cf5628b:



    voice "2HI_1255"
    hina "「……这样啊。看来最后还是要我们俩自己做决定。但是我们有同伴，伦和圣夜子她们俩……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_740433b3:



    voice "2FU_1001"
    fumi "「圣夜子是，祥子姐肯定也是」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_d9937b96:


    "阳菜点点头。"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_e1f3b04f:



    voice "2HI_1256"
    hina "「伦提到了圣诞节那天在教堂发生的事」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_a1218598:



    voice "2FU_1002"
    fumi "「圣夜子也和我说了」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_79d95881:



    voice "2HI_1257"
    hina "「我们向天使发过誓了呢……」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_62c879ce:


    hina_fumi "「就算变成老太婆也会深爱着对方，会永远珍视彼此」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_f5e67796:



    voice "2HI_1259"
    hina "「现在也还是这么想吗？」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_a65a7e85:



    voice "2FU_1004"
    fumi "「好」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_ba1245ad:



    voice "2HI_1260"
    hina "「我们要遵守誓言，今后也不能认输，要一直在一起」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_d07bd672:



    voice "2FU_1005"
    fumi "「一定会的」"


translate simplified_chinese a10_cou1_06_16f6013a:


    "二人的手紧紧相扣。"
